{"id":"inocencia","lemma":"inocencia","pos":"noun","rank":3228,"glosses":["innocence"],"ipa":"/inoˈθenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"inocencias"},"examples":[{"text":"Este hecho prueba su inocencia.","en":"This fact proves her innocence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538014","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"proof"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"La inocencia es una cosa hermosa.","en":"Innocence is a beautiful thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645193","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"thing"},{"g":"gorgeous","l":"hermoso"}]},{"text":"Estoy convencido de su inocencia.","en":"I am convinced of her innocence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526623","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"convinced"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Todos estamos convencidos de su inocencia.","en":"We are all convinced of his innocence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707276","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"convinced","l":"convencido"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"No debes aprovecharte de su inocencia.","en":"You must not take advantage of her innocence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691914","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to make use of","l":"aprovechar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}